# Termvox 4K demo — VHS tape (3840×2160 @ 60fps)
Output docs/assets/termvox-demo-4k.mp4

Set Width 3840
Set Height 2160
Set FontSize 42
Set Framerate 60
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set MarginFill "#141820"
Set Padding 40

Type "termvox --version"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "termvox doctor"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "termvox test --seconds 2"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Type "# termvox shell setup — F8 voice flow"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# F8 — toggle voice capture in termvox shell"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# F8 again — stop recording and send audio for transcription"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "# Transcript is inserted at the cursor (or copied to clipboard)"
Enter
Sleep 3s
